00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.930
You can do all kinds of fancy stuff with reinforcement
learning, right.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:23.450
So the crux in reinforcement learning is that
the agent is going to there is this learning

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.810
agent right it is going to learn in close
interaction with an environment, right. So

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:33.730
the environment could be the helicopter, it
could be the cycle right and or it could be

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:38.149
your backgammon board and your opponent all
of this could constitute the environment variety

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:42.610
of different choices, so you sense the state
in which the environment is in right.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:48.040
Sense the state of the environment okay and
figure out what is the action that you should

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:52.630
take in response to the state, right. So when
you apply the action back to the environment

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:58.560
this causes a change in the state right. So
now comes in tricky part right so you should

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:04.330
not just choose actions that are beneficial
in the current state but you should choose

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:10.180
actions in such a way that they will put you
in a state which is beneficial for you in

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.890
the future, right.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:17.340
Just capturing the queen of your opponent
is not enough in chess that might give you

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.733
a higher reward but it might put you in a
really bad position, so you do not want that

00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:25.580
right you really want to be looking at the
entire sequence of decisions that you are

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:29.930
going to have to make and then try to behave
optimally with respect to that, right. So

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:35.380
what we mean by behave optimally in this case
right we are going to assume that the environment

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:40.410
right is giving you some kind of an evaluation.
It is like falling down hurts when or capturing

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:46.500
a piece maybe gives you a small plus 0.5 or
winning the game gives you like hundred right,

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:50.720
so every time you win every time you make
a move or every time you execute an action

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:56.020
you did not get a reward or you need not get
an evaluation from the environment right so

00:01:56.020 --> 00:02:01.479
it could be just zero it could be this could
be nothing, right. So I should point out that

00:02:01.479 --> 00:02:06.899
this whole idea of having an evaluation come
from the environment is just a mathematical

00:02:06.899 --> 00:02:09.110
convenience that we have here.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.140
But in reality if you think about biological
systems that are learning using reinforcement

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:19.051
learning right all they are getting is the
usual sensory inputs right so there is some

00:02:19.051 --> 00:02:23.790
fraction in the brain okay that sits there
and interprets some of those sensory input

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:33.730
as rewards or punishments, right so you fall
down you get hurt I mean that is still a sensory

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.110
input that is coming from your skin right
or somebody pats you on your back thats still

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.510
a sensory input that comes from the skin.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:44.360
And it is just another kind of an input right
so you could choose to interpret this as a

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:50.340
reward right or this as a collision with an
obstacle something is brushing against my

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:54.360
shoulder let me move away right or you can
just take it as somebody is patting my back

00:02:54.360 --> 00:03:00.140
so I did something good right so it is a matter
of interpretation so this is a this whole

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:05.310
thing about having a state signal and having
a separate evaluation coming from the environment

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.610
is a fiction right.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:12.590
That is created to have a cleaner mathematical
model but in reality things are a lot messier

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:18.810
you know you do not have such a clean separation,
right and like I said so you have a stochastic

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:22.209
environment you have delayed evaluation.

00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:33.360
Noisy so the new term that we have added here
